---
// Prime Video's monitoring tool: where the serverless bill came from, and the one-process fix.
// Facts from the Prime Video Tech post cited in the post. No numbers are invented.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 380;
function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const p1 = [x2 - 8 * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - 8 * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - 8 * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - 8 * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return { line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`, head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}` };
}
const a1 = arrow(210, 124, 340, 124);
const a2 = arrow(560, 124, 690, 124);
const a3 = arrow(150, 292, 250, 292);
---
<figure class="topf">
  <div class="topf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Before: a media converter writes each frame to S3, and a detector downloads it from S3 to check it. AWS Step Functions orchestrates and bills several state transitions for every second of every stream, and every frame passes through many small S3 calls. After: converter and detectors run in one process and pass frames in memory; to scale, run more copies of the process.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="topf-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Before: serverless, frames travel through S3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trước: serverless, khung hình đi qua S3</tspan></text>

    <rect x="130" y="40" width="640" height="34" rx="8" class="topf-sf" />
    <DiagramIcon name="sync" x={156} y={57} size={20} />
    <text x="180" y="62" class="topf-red"><tspan data-lang-en>Step Functions: several state transitions per second of stream, each one billed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Step Functions: nhiều lần chuyển trạng thái mỗi giây stream, lần nào cũng tính tiền</tspan></text>

    <g class="topf-box"><rect x="20" y="90" width="190" height="68" rx="8" /></g>
    <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={46} y={124} size={26} />
    <text x="72" y="118" class="topf-name"><tspan data-lang-en>Media converter</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bộ chuyển đổi</tspan></text>
    <text x="72" y="138" class="topf-small"><tspan data-lang-en>splits frames, audio</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tách khung hình, âm thanh</tspan></text>
    <g class="topf-arrow is-bad"><path d={a1.line} /><polygon points={a1.head} /></g>
    <text x="275" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="topf-redsmall"><tspan data-lang-en>1. store</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. lưu</tspan></text>

    <g class="topf-box"><rect x="340" y="90" width="220" height="68" rx="8" /></g>
    <DiagramIcon name="s3" x={368} y={124} size={28} />
    <text x="396" y="118" class="topf-name"><tspan data-lang-en>S3 bucket</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>S3 bucket</tspan></text>
    <text x="396" y="138" class="topf-small"><tspan data-lang-en>holds every frame</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giữ mọi khung hình</tspan></text>
    <g class="topf-arrow is-bad"><path d={a2.line} /><polygon points={a2.head} /></g>
    <text x="625" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="topf-redsmall"><tspan data-lang-en>2. download</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. tải về</tspan></text>

    <g class="topf-box"><rect x="690" y="90" width="190" height="68" rx="8" /></g>
    <DiagramIcon name="lambda" x={716} y={124} size={26} />
    <text x="742" y="118" class="topf-name"><tspan data-lang-en>Detector</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Detector</tspan></text>
    <text x="742" y="138" class="topf-small"><tspan data-lang-en>checks one piece</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm tra từng mảnh</tspan></text>

    <text x="450" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="topf-red"><tspan data-lang-en>Many small S3 calls to pass frames around: a hard limit at about 5% of the expected load</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Rất nhiều lần gọi S3 nhỏ để chuyển khung hình: đụng giới hạn cứng ở khoảng 5% tải dự kiến</tspan></text>

    <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="212" y2="212" class="topf-rule" />
    <text x="20" y="238" class="topf-h"><tspan data-lang-en>After: one process, frames stay in memory</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sau: một process, khung hình nằm trong bộ nhớ</tspan></text>

    <rect x="20" y="254" width="360" height="100" rx="10" class="topf-new" />
    <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={46} y={292} size={26} />
    <text x="70" y="296" class="topf-name"><tspan data-lang-en>Converter</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chuyển đổi</tspan></text>
    <g class="topf-arrow"><path d={a3.line} /><polygon points={a3.head} /></g>
    <text x="200" y="282" text-anchor="middle" class="topf-goodsmall"><tspan data-lang-en>in memory</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trong bộ nhớ</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="lambda" x={272} y={292} size={26} />
    <text x="296" y="296" class="topf-name"><tspan data-lang-en>Detectors</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Detector</tspan></text>
    <text x="36" y="338" class="topf-small"><tspan data-lang-en>one process on Amazon ECS and EC2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một process trên Amazon ECS và EC2</tspan></text>

    <text x="410" y="290" class="topf-good"><tspan data-lang-en>To scale: run more copies of the process,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Để scale: chạy thêm bản sao của process,</tspan></text>
    <text x="410" y="308" class="topf-good"><tspan data-lang-en>each with a subset of the detectors.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mỗi bản giữ một phần các detector.</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={430} y={338} size={22} />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={466} y={338} size={22} />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={502} y={338} size={22} />
    <text x="540" y="343" class="topf-name"><tspan data-lang-en>Infrastructure cost down over 90%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chi phí hạ tầng giảm hơn 90%</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Top: every step of one job pays a network and billing toll. Bottom: the same steps inside one process pay nothing to hand a frame over.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trên: mỗi bước của cùng một việc đều phải trả phí mạng và phí tính tiền. Dưới: cùng các bước đó trong một process thì chuyển khung hình không tốn gì.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .topf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .topf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .topf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .topf text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .topf .topf-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .topf .topf-name { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .topf .topf-small { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .topf .topf-red, .topf .topf-redsmall { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .topf .topf-redsmall { font-size: 12px; }
  .topf .topf-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .topf .topf-goodsmall { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .topf-box rect { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .topf-sf { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .topf-new { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .topf-arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .topf-arrow polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .topf-arrow.is-bad path { stroke: var(--red); }
  .topf-arrow.is-bad polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .topf-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
  .topf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
